#: classes/templates.php:267
msgid "AI Draft Writer"
msgstr ""

#: classes/templates.php:269
msgid "On a schedule, AI Engine writes a full blog post about your topic and saves it as a draft for you to review. Edit the topic inside the AI step before activating."
msgstr ""

#: classes/templates.php:270
#: classes/templates.php:304
#: classes/templates.php:338
#: classes/templates.php:405
#: classes/templates.php:454
msgid "AI"
msgstr ""

#: classes/templates.php:276
msgid "Every week at 8:00 AM"
msgstr ""

#: classes/templates.php:278
msgid ""
"You write for the blog \"{{ site_name }}\".\n"
"\n"
"TOPIC (edit me!): practical tips our readers can use. Pick one fresh, specific angle each time.\n"
"\n"
"Write an original blog post on that topic: an engaging title and 4-6 short paragraphs, with optional subheadings. No invented facts.\n"
"\n"
"The content must be Gutenberg block markup, so it opens as real blocks in the editor and inherits your theme's styles. Wrap every paragraph as:\n"
"<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n"
"<p>Your paragraph.</p>\n"
"<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n"
"and every subheading as:\n"
"<!-- wp:heading -->\n"
"<h2>Your subheading</h2>\n"
"<!-- /wp:heading -->\n"
"\n"
"Return ONLY JSON: {\"title\": \"…\", \"content\": \"…\"}"
msgstr ""

#: classes/templates.php:301
msgid "Turn Feeds Into Drafts"
msgstr ""

#: classes/templates.php:303
msgid "When a new item appears in a feed you choose, AI Engine rewrites it in your site's voice and saves it as a draft, linking back to the source. Set the feed URL in the trigger before activating."
msgstr ""

#: classes/templates.php:310
msgid "When a new RSS item appears"
msgstr ""

#: classes/templates.php:312
msgid ""
"You write for the blog \"{{ site_name }}\".\n"
"\n"
"Below is a news item from another site. Write a SHORT original post about it in our own voice: summarise the key points in your own words (never copy sentences), 2-4 paragraphs.\n"
"\n"
"The content must be Gutenberg block markup, so it opens as real blocks in the editor and inherits your theme's styles. Wrap every paragraph as:\n"
"<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n"
"<p>Your paragraph.</p>\n"
"<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n"
"The last paragraph must credit the source exactly like this:\n"
"<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n"
"<p>Source: <a href=\"{{ trigger.link }}\">{{ trigger.title }}</a></p>\n"
"<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n"
"\n"
"Return ONLY JSON: {\"title\": \"…\", \"content\": \"…\"}\n"
"\n"
"SOURCE TITLE: {{ trigger.title }}\n"
"SOURCE CONTENT:\n"
"{{ trigger.content }}"
msgstr ""

